          },
          {
            "title": "Question 4",
            "id": 126534,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Manakah dari perbandingan berikut yang menghasilkan <code>true</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"apple\" == \"apple\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"apple\" == \"orange\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>\"apple\" == \"apple\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 1",
            "id": 126535,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Periksa apakah <code>myAnswer</code> sama dengan <code>solution</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" myAnswer = \" /><text value=\"&quot;act&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" solution = \" /><text value=\"&quot;ace&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(myAnswer == solution)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>==</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 2",
            "id": 126536,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Simpan sebuah string dalam <code>solution</code> agar perbandingannya menjadi <code>false</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" myAnswer = \" /><text value=\"&quot;high&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" solution = \" /><text value=\"&quot;low&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(myAnswer == solution)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;high&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"low\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 3",
            "id": 126537,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Simpan sebuah string dalam <code>item2</code> agar hasil perbandingannya menjadi <code>false</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" item1 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;deerstalker hat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" item2 = \" /><text value=\"&quot;pipe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isDuplicate = item1 == item2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(isDuplicate)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;deerstalker hat&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"pipe\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
