            "id": 126538,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Periksa apakah <code>\"liquid\"</code> sama dengan <code>\"solid\"</code> menggunakan <code>==</code>.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;liquid&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" == \" /><text value=\"&quot;solid&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"17\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>==</code>.</p></body></html>"
